Package: e9s
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal workspace for operating AWS resources
 e9s is a keyboard-oriented terminal user interface for observing and
 operating AWS resources across ECS, CloudWatch, EC2, RDS, and related
 services.

Package: e9s-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: e9s
Description: native GTK workspace for operating AWS resources
 e9s-gui is the native GTK 4 frontend for e9s. It includes GtkSourceView and
 VTE integration, desktop metadata, icons, and application-private fonts.
